{"id":72859,"date":"2026-11-06T08:09:30","date_gmt":"2026-11-06T08:09:30","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=72859"},"modified":"2026-11-06T09:11:13","modified_gmt":"2026-11-06T08:11:13","slug":"trail-real-da-tapada-da-mafra","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/trail-real-da-tapada-da-mafra\/","title":{"rendered":"Trail da Tapada Real de Mafra 2027"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Trail da Tapada Real de Mafra 2027<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>Trail da Tapada Real de Mafra 2027<\/strong> realiza-se no dia <strong>18 de abril de 2027<\/strong> (domingo), no interior da hist\u00f3rica <strong>Tapada Nacional de Mafra<\/strong>, no concelho de <strong>Mafra<\/strong>, distrito de <strong>Lisboa<\/strong>. Com concentra\u00e7\u00e3o, partida e meta instaladas no parque fronteiri\u00e7o da <strong>Casa do Salabredo<\/strong> (acesso \u00fanico ao p\u00fablico pelo <strong>Port\u00e3o do Code\u00e7al<\/strong>), a prova integra os circuitos <strong>Mafra Trail Running Series<\/strong> e <strong>Merrell Trail Running Series<\/strong>.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Os percursos de <strong>20 km<\/strong> (Trail Longo, partida \u00e0s 09:00), <strong>12 km<\/strong> (Trail Curto, partida \u00e0s 09:00) e a <strong>Caminhada de 12 km<\/strong> (partida \u00e0s 09:05) desenrolam-se integralmente dentro dos muros da antiga reserva de ca\u00e7a real criada no reinado de D. Jo\u00e3o V, Patrim\u00f3nio Mundial da UNESCO associado ao Pal\u00e1cio Nacional de Mafra. Vais correr em plena comunh\u00e3o com a biodiversidade aut\u00f3ctone \u2014 entre gamos, veados-vermelhos, javalis e bosque denso \u2014 em regime de semi-autossufici\u00eancia ambiental e com um tempo limite global de 5 horas.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o t\u00e9cnica e desportiva deste evento de refer\u00eancia no calend\u00e1rio nacional de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/trail\/\">trail running<\/a> \u00e9 assegurada em parceria pela <strong>Trail4U<\/strong> e pela <strong>Tapada Nacional de Mafra<\/strong>.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(2