x solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\"><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">1\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 16.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 24\/01\/2027)<\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">2\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 18.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (25\/01 a 28\/02\/2027)<\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">3\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 20.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (01\/03 a 11\/04\/2027)<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 200px;\"><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Caminhada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Caminhada (CAM)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 18 de Abril de 2027 \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:05<\/span><\/div><div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\"><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">1\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 14.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 24\/01\/2027)<\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">2\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 16.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (25\/01 a 28\/02\/2027)<\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">3\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 17.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (01\/03 a 11\/04\/2027)<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/ul><\/div><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde \u00e9 a partida do Trail da Tapada Real de Mafra 2027?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O Trail da Tapada Real de Mafra 2027 realiza-se no domingo, 18 de abril de 2027, na Tapada Nacional de Mafra. A partida e a meta situam-se no parque fronteiri\u00e7o da Casa do Salabredo, com entrada \u00fanica pelo Port\u00e3o do Code\u00e7al e abertura do Controlo Zero \u00e0s 08:30.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os hor\u00e1rios e as dist\u00e2ncias do Trail da Tapada Real de Mafra?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O programa conta com tr\u00eas provas: o Trail Longo de 20 km e o Trail Curto de 12 km partem em simult\u00e2neo \u00e0s 09:00, enquanto a Caminhada n\u00e3o competitiva de 12 km parte \u00e0s 09:05. Podes preparar os teus ritmos na nossa <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/calculadora\/\">calculadora de pace<\/a>.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os e fases de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o para a edi\u00e7\u00e3o de 2027?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Na 1\u00aa fase (at\u00e9 24 de janeiro de 2027), os pre\u00e7os s\u00e3o de 20 \u20ac no Trail Longo, 16 \u20ac no Trail Curto e 14 \u20ac na Caminhada. Na 2\u00aa fase (25 de janeiro a 28 de fevereiro), passam para 22 \u20ac, 18 \u20ac e 16 \u20ac; e na 3\u00aa fase (1 de mar\u00e7o a 11 de abril de 2027) fixam-se em 24 \u20ac, 20 \u20ac e 17 \u20ac, respetivamente, com limite global de 500 vagas.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o tempo limite e o material obrigat\u00f3rio na prova?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Todas as dist\u00e2ncias t\u00eam um tempo limite de 5 horas ap\u00f3s a partida. Sendo uma prova em semi-autossufici\u00eancia, \u00e9 obrigat\u00f3rio levar dorsal vis\u00edvel (trazer alfinetes pr\u00f3prios), telem\u00f3vel com bateria e recipiente pr\u00f3prio (copo, cantil ou camelbak), pois n\u00e3o s\u00e3o fornecidos copos nos abastecimentos.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quem organiza o Trail da Tapada Real de Mafra e o que inclui a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento \u00e9 organizado pela Trail4U e pela Tapada Nacional de Mafra, integrando mais provas em <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/corridas-lisboa\/\">Lisboa<\/a>. A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o inclui gola oficial, dorsal com chip, seguro desportivo, abastecimentos s\u00f3lidos e l\u00edquidos e assist\u00eancia m\u00e9dica.<\/div><\/details><\/div><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Trail da Tapada Real de Mafra 2027\", \"startDate\": \"2027-04-18\", \"endDate\": \"2027-04-18\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Tapada Nacional de Mafra (Casa do Salabredo), Mafra\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Mafra\", \"addressRegion\": \"Lisboa\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"description\": \"O Trail da Tapada Real de Mafra 2027 realiza-se a 18 de abril na Tapada Nacional de Mafra. Trail de 20 km, 12 km e Caminhada. Consulta hor\u00e1rios e inscri\u00e7\u00f5es!\", \"image\": [\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/11\/cartaz-trail-real-da-tapada-da-mafra.webp\"], \"offers\": [{\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Trail Longo (TL)\", \"price\": \"20.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/www.trilhoperdido.com\/evento\/Trail-da-Tapada-Real-de-Mafra-2027\", \"validFrom\": \"2027-01-01\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Trail Curto (TC)\", \"price\": \"16.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/www.trilhoperdido.com\/evento\/Trail-da-Tapada-Real-de-Mafra-2027\", \"validFrom\": \"2027-01-01\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Caminhada (CAM)\", \"price\": \"14.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/www.trilhoperdido.com\/evento\/Trail-da-Tapada-Real-de-Mafra-2027\", \"validFrom\": \"2027-01-01\"}], \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Trail4U e Tapada Nacional de Mafra\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando e onde \u00e9 a partida do Trail da Tapada Real de Mafra 2027?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O Trail da Tapada Real de Mafra 2027 realiza-se no domingo, 18 de abril de 2027, na Tapada Nacional de Mafra. A partida e a meta situam-se no parque fronteiri\u00e7o da Casa do Salabredo, com entrada \u00fanica pelo Port\u00e3o do Code\u00e7al e abertura do Controlo Zero \u00e0s 08:30.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o os hor\u00e1rios e as dist\u00e2ncias do Trail da Tapada Real de Mafra?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O programa conta com tr\u00eas provas: o Trail Longo de 20 km e o Trail Curto de 12 km partem em simult\u00e2neo \u00e0s 09:00, enquanto a Caminhada n\u00e3o competitiva de 12 km parte \u00e0s 09:05. Podes preparar os teus ritmos na nossa calculadora de pace .\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os e fases de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o para a edi\u00e7\u00e3o de 2027?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Na 1\u00aa fase (at\u00e9 24 de janeiro de 2027), os pre\u00e7os s\u00e3o de 20 \u20ac no Trail Longo, 16 \u20ac no Trail Curto e 14 \u20ac na Caminhada. Na 2\u00aa fase (25 de janeiro a 28 de fevereiro), passam para 22 \u20ac, 18 \u20ac e 16 \u20ac; e na 3\u00aa fase (1 de mar\u00e7o a 11 de abril de 2027) fixam-se em 24 \u20ac, 20 \u20ac e 17 \u20ac, respetivamente, com limite global de 500 vagas.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 o tempo limite e o material obrigat\u00f3rio na prova?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Todas as dist\u00e2ncias t\u00eam um tempo limite de 5 horas ap\u00f3s a partida. Sendo uma prova em semi-autossufici\u00eancia, \u00e9 obrigat\u00f3rio levar dorsal vis\u00edvel (trazer alfinetes pr\u00f3prios), telem\u00f3vel com bateria e recipiente pr\u00f3prio (copo, cantil ou camelbak), pois n\u00e3o s\u00e3o fornecidos copos nos abastecimentos.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quem organiza o Trail da Tapada Real de Mafra e o que inclui a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento \u00e9 organizado pela Trail4U e pela Tapada Nacional de Mafra, integrando mais provas em Lisboa . A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o inclui gola oficial, dorsal com chip, seguro desportivo, abastecimentos s\u00f3lidos e l\u00edquidos e assist\u00eancia m\u00e9dica.\"}}]}<\/script>","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":72860,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[672,22,497],"event_type_2":[33,727,820],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-72859","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","ev